Aberdeen,,,English,/æb.ə.ˈdiːn/(British English)|/ˈæb.ɚ.ˌdin/(American English),,,,,,,"Means ""mouth of the Don (river)"" in Scottish Gaelic. This is the name of the name of a city in northern Scotland, as well as several other cities worldwide named after the Scottish city."
