Abnody,m,Абно́ди(Russian),"Russian (Rare, Archaic)",,,,,,,,"Abnody (Russian: Абно́дий) is an old and rare Russian male first name. The patronymics derived from this first name are ""Абно́диевич"" (Abnodiyevich), ""Абно́дьевич"" (Abnodyevich; both masculine); and ""Абно́диевна"" (Abnodiyevna), ""Абнодьевна"" (Abnodyevna; both feminine)."
