Aedumanda,f,,Celtic Mythology (Hypothetical),,,,,,,,Reconstructed old Celtic form of Aimend.
Aedus,m,,"Irish (Latinized, Archaic)",,,,,,,,Possibly a Latinized form of Aodh.Some dictionaries dating back to the 1800s have Aedus listed as an Irish saint.
