Aeji,f,"애지(Korean Hangul)|愛智, 愛地(Korean Hanja)",Korean,/e.ˈd͡ʒi/,,,,,,,"From Sino-Korean 愛 (ae) meaning ""love, affection"" and 智 (ji) meaning ""wisdom, intellect"" or 地 (ji) meaning ""earth, soil, ground"". Other hanja character combinations are possible."
