Agasa,f,"あがさ(Japanese Hiragana)|アガサ(Japanese Katakana)|開夏彩, 明雅砂, 有伽沙, 阿笠, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese (Rare),A-GA-SA,,,,,,,"From Japanese 亜 (a) meaning ""second, Asia"", 芽 (ga) meaning ""bud, sprout, shoot"" combined with 沙 (sa) meaning ""sand"". Other kanji combinations are possible.Usage of this name is most likely influenced by the name Agatha."
