Agion,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"A knight who, with his brother Agano, joined their cousin Harpin in his siege of the Castle of Three Maidens. Sir Hector of the Fens and the King with a Hundred Knights arrived to defend the castle, and Agion and Agano were killed."
