Akammboñaa,f,,Jola,,,,,,,,"Means ""she tries it for nothing"" or ""she does it there for nothing"" in Jola-Fonyi. This is applied to a woman in reference to her repeated failure to carry a pregnancy to term, implying the bearer gets pregnant in vain."
