Akzholtoy,,Акжолтой(Kyrgyz),Kyrgyz (Rare),,,,,,,,"Historical and cultural backgroundThe name Akzholtoy (Акжолтой) emerged within the nomadic worldview of the Kyrgyz people:The concept of the “road” (жол, jol) was central to life:seasonal migrationtravel and movementone’s life path or destinyThe color white (ак, ak) in Turkic tradition symbolizes:blessingpuritydivine favorNames of this type were often given:as a blessing or wish for the childwithout strict gender distinction."
