Albinovanus,m,,Ancient Roman,,,,,,,,"Roman family name of Etruscan origin. This was borne by an obscure Plebeian family only known from inscriptions. They are most remembered by a single member, Publius Albinovanus, who is still fairly obscure."
Albīns,m,,Latvian (Rare),,,,,,,,Latvian form of Albin.
