Alcidice,f,Ἀλκιδίκη(Ancient Greek),Greek Mythology (Latinized),,,,,,,,"Latinized form of Ἀλκιδίκη (Alkidike), which is derived from Greek αλκη (alke) ""strength, prowess"" combined with δικη (dike) meaning ""justice, judgement"" as well as ""custom, usage"". In Greek mythology, Alcidice was the mother of Tyro."
