Alexanor,m,Ἀλεξάνωρ(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek|Greek Mythology,,,,,,,,"Derived from the Greek verb ἀλέξω (alexo) meaning ""to defend"" as well as ""to help"" combined with the Greek noun ἀνήρ (aner) meaning ""man"".In Greek mythology, Alexanor is a grandson of the god Asclepius."
