Almáriel,f,,Literature,,,,,,,,"A fictional character created by J.R.R. Tolkien. Almáriel was young woman of Númenor. Almáriel was a peer of Herendil, who was mocked by him with the nicknames Eärendel or Terendul. In fact, despite his royal blood, Herendil's peer accused him of being a ""half-Noldo"".Almáriel means ""blessed woman"" in Quenya."
