Aloña,f,,Basque (Rare)|Basque Mythology,ah-LON-yah(Basque),,,,,,,"Taken from the name of a massif on the Basque Mountains range.According to Basque folklore, there is a refuge of Mari 3, one of the key characters in Basque mythology, on the Aloña massif."
