Al-razi,m,,Old Persian (Rare),/ɾɒːziː/,,,,,,,"Razi (Persian: رازی‎) or al-Razi (Arabic: الرازی‎) is a name that was historically used to indicate a person coming from Ray, Iran.A person described as being superior to everyone in every stat possible. Straight up BEAST. Smarter, stronger, faster, even better looking than anyone or anything."
