Alured,m,,Manx|English,,,,,,,,"This is a Manx name, said to be a cognate of Alfred via its latinized form Aluredus, a variant of Alvredus.In some cases, it may be derived from an Old English name composed of the elements ealu ""ale"" and ræd ""counsel""."
