Amaterrahmane,f,,"Arabic (Maghrebi, Rare)",,,,,,,,"Means ""maidservant of the merciful"" from Arabic أمة ال (amat al) meaning ""maidservant of the"" combined with رحمن (rahman) meaning ""merciful""."
