Amato,,"天斗, 亜人, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese|Italian,AH-MAH-TO|Em-OH-toh,,,,,,,"From Japanese 天 (ama) meaning ""heaven, sky"" combined with 斗 (to), which refers to a Chinese constellation. Other kanji combinations are possible."
