Ananiah,m,ענניה(Ancient Hebrew),Biblical,,,,,,,,"Means ""cloud of Yahweh"" or ""Yahweh has covered"", from the Hebrew nouns עָנָן (ʿanan) ""cloud"" and יָהּ (yah) referring to the Hebrew God. This is the name of a minor character mentioned in the Old Testament."
