Andriyana,f,Андріяна(Ukrainian)|Андриана(Bulgarian),Ukrainian (Rare)|Bulgarian,,,,,,,,"Ukrainian form and Bulgarian variant transcription of Андриана (see Andriana). In Ukraine, this name is mostly used in west part of country."
