Antarctica,f,,English (Rare),/æn.ˈtɑɹk.tɪ.kə/(American English)|/æn.ˈtɑɹ.tɪ.kə/(American English)|/æn.ˈtɑːk.tɪ.kə/(British English)|/æn.ˈtɑː.tɪ.kə/(British English),,,,,,,"From the continent of Antarctica, which is a romanized version of the Greek compound word ἀνταρκτική (antarktiké), feminine of ἀνταρκτικός (antarktikós), meaning ""opposite to the Arctic, opposite to the north""."
