Antolina,f,,Italian (Rare)|Spanish (Rare),,,,,,,,"Diminutive of Antonia. Perhaps most famously borne by author Anaïs Nin, whose full birth name was Angela Anaïs Juana Antolina Rosa Edelmira Nin y Culmell."
