Antóna,f,,Kashubian,,,,,,,,Feminine form of Antón.
Antona,f,,Sardinian|Galician|Romansh,,,,,,,,Sardinian form and Galician variant of Antonia.
Antonakis,m,Αντωνάκης(Greek),Greek,,,,,,,,"Modern Greek diminutive of Antonios and Antonis, as it contains the modern Greek diminutive suffix -άκης (-akis). This name is typically only used informally, meaning: it does not appear on birth certificates."
