Anzheng,m,"岸峥, 岸正(Chinese)",Chinese,,,,,,,,"From the Chinese 岸 (àn) meaning ""beach, shore"" and 峥 (zhēng) meaning ""high, lofty, noble"" or 正 (zhèng) meaning ""correct, right, proper""."
Anzhi,f,"安治, 安志, 安智, etc.(Chinese)",Chinese (Modern),AHN-CHEE,,,,,,,"Combination of the names An 1 and Zhi, can also be a form of Angie or Angi."
Anzhik,f,Անժիկ(Armenian),Armenian,,,,,,,,Armenian diminutive of Anzhela.
