Aon,f,"亜音, 空音, 蒼音, 碧音, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,AH-ON,,,,,,,"From Japanese 亜 (a) meaning ""second, Asia"", 空 (a) meaning ""sky"", 蒼 (a) meaning ""blue, green"" or 碧 (a) meaning ""jade, green, blue"" combined with 音 (on) meaning ""sound"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
