Aoya,m,"碧哉, 葵哉, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,AH-O-YAH,,,,,,,"From Japanese 碧 (ao) meaning ""jade, blue, green"" combined with 哉 (ya), an exclamation. This name can be formed with other kanji combinations as well."
