Aoyo,f,"蒼世, 蒼代, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,AH-O-YO,,,,,,,"From Japanese 蒼 (ao) meaning ""blue, green"" combined with 世 (yo) meaning ""world"". Other kanji combinations are possible.This name is also used as a surname."
