Aoyun,,"奧運, 奥运, 奥云, 傲云, 傲雲, etc.(Chinese)",Chinese,/ɑu.ɥyn/,,,,,,,"From Chinese “奥运”(àoyùn), the abbreviation of 奧林匹克運動會/奥林匹克运动会 (Àolínpǐkè yùndònghuì) meaning ""Olympic Games"". Other homophonic hanzi combinations can be used to give the name extra meaning."
