Apamoun,m,"Ⲁⲡⲁⲙⲟⲩⲛ, Ⲁⲡⲁⲙⲩⲛ(Coptic)",Coptic,,,,,,,,"Probably derived from Coptic apa Amoun, where apa means ""father"" and Amoun is the Coptic form of Amon. The name thus essentially means ""father Amon"". However, it may also be possible that the name is a more extended form of Pamoun."
