Apolaki,m,ᜀᜉᜓᜎᜃᜒ(Baybayin),Philippine Mythology,,,,,,,,"Means ""giant lord"" from the Tagalog title apo meaning ""lord, master"" and laki meaning ""big, large"". In Tagalog mythology Apolaki was the god of the sun and war and the brother of Mayari. After a war with his sister, which resulted in Mayari losing an eye, he came to rule the world during the day."
