Apollyon,m,,Judeo-Christian-Islamic Legend|Literature,ah-POLL-ee-on; uh-POLL-yon(Judeo-Christian-Islamic Legend),,,,,,,"The Greek name for Abaddon, Hebrew for “The destroyer” or “Place of destruction”.In the Hebrew scriptures, Abaddon is a place – the realm of the unhappy dead or a place of lost souls. In Christian apocalyptic theology, Abaddon was seen as the angel of death, or even the Antichrist or Satan."
