Aragog,m,,Popular Culture,AHR-ah-gog,,,,,,,"From J K Rowling's Harry Potter series, Aragog is the name of the giant spider that lives in the Forbidden Forest. He fears basilisks and is a great friend of Rubeus Hagrid, who rescued him when he was a child and cared for him. Aragog is well known for his contribution of the Chamber of Secrets in the second book."
