Arandus,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"In La Tavola Ritonda, a Gaulish king who, along with a king named Brandino, invaded and conquered Benoic (Benwick) – the land of Lancelot’s father Ban.Arandus and Brandino replace Claudas, named as Benoic’s destroyers in most other versions."
