Archagathos,m,Ἀρχάγαθος(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek,,,,,,,,"The first element of this name is either derived from Greek ἀρχός (archos) ""master"" or from Greek ἀρχή (arche) ""origin, source"". The second element is derived from Greek ἀγαθός (agathos) meaning ""good""."
