Ariabignes,m,Ἀριαβίγνης(Ancient Greek),Old Persian (Hellenized),,,,,,,,"One of the sons of the Persian king Darius I. He participated in the Second Persian invasion of Greece as one of the four admirals of the fleet of his brother Xerxes I, and was killed in the Battle of Salamis in 480 BC."
