Aristanor,m,Ἀριστάνωρ(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek,,,,,,,,"Derived from the Greek adjective ἄριστος (aristos) meaning ""best"" combined with the Greek noun ἀνήρ (aner) meaning ""man"".Also compare the Greek name Aristandros, which is closely related and essentially means the same."
