Ashundria,f,,African American,ah-SHAWN-dree-ah; uh-SHAWN-dree-uh,,,,,,,"Ashundria — a modern Black American feminine given name originating in the Southern United States. Ashundrias are known for resilience, inner brightness, poetic beauty, spiritual and mental strength, groundedness, and empathy, radiating presence, visibility, and a quiet power that leaves a lasting impact. A known bearer of this name is Dr. Ashundria Veronique Oliver."
