Atori,f,"花鶏, 花鳥, 亜鳥, 娃鳥, etc.(Japanese Kanji)|あとり(Japanese Hiragana)|アトリ(Japanese Katakana)",Japanese (Rare),[á.tò̞.ɾʲì],,,,,,,"From 花鶏 (atori), referring to the brambling bird.Other kanji can be used for this name, like 鳥 meaning ""bird"" for the second kanji, 亜 or 娃 for the first kanji, the latter meaning ""beautiful.""One fictional bearer of this name is Atoli (アトリ), a main character in the '.hack//G.U.' series.This name is rarely used."
