Auszrine,f,,Baltic Mythology,,,,,,,,"Either an older or a Polonized form of Aušrinė (or possibly both seeing as many of the early documents on Baltic deities were composed by Polish authors).Auszrine was so beautiful that, when she was born, the hypnotized moon was unable to rise for days and the sun was forced to descend into the sea."
