Badelihan,m,巴德里汗(Chinese),Chinese|Kazakh (Sinicized),,,,,,,,"Meaning unknown, possibly a Siniced form of an Kazakh name. It is written with the Chinese characters 巴 (see Ba) combined with 德 (see De), 里 (see Li 1) and 汗 (see Han 1).Other characters combinations are also possible.Hadesi Badelihan is a Chinese cross-country skier of Kazakh ethinicity who competed at 2022 Winter Olympics."
