Baizhu,m,"白朮, 白术(Chinese)",Chinese,PIE-CHOO,,,,,,,"From Chinese 白 (bái) meaning ""white, pure"" and 朮, 术 (zhú) meaning ""glutinous millet"". Other character combinations can form this name as well.This name, using the combinations 白朮, refers to a rhizome of the Atractylodes macrocephala, a plant used as an herb in traditional Chinese medicine. It is borne by a character in the miHoYo video game Genshin Impact."
