Bakaffa,m,,Eastern African,,,,,,,,"Bakaffa (throne name Asma Sagad, later Masih Sagad Ge'ez መሲህ ሰገድ, ""to whom the anointed bows"") was nəgusä nägäst (May 18, 1721 – September 19, 1730) of Ethiopia, and a member of the Solomonic dynasty. He was a son of Emperor Iyasu I and brother to Emperors Tekle Haymanot I and Dawit III."
