Bartine,f,,English|Dutch,bahr-TEE-nə(Dutch)|bahr-TEEN(Dutch),,,,,,,Feminine form of Bartholomew. A known bearer of this name is the late American film actress Bartine Burkett. The name is sometimes erroneously interpreted as a variant spelling of Bertine.
