Begge,f,,French (Belgian)|History (Ecclesiastical),,,,,,,,"French form of Begga. Saint Begge (615 – 17 December 693) was the grandmother of Charles Martel, who is the grandfather of Charlemagne. She had seven churches built at Andenne on the Meuse, Belgium, where she spent the rest of her days as abbess."
