Beglar,m,ბეგლარ(Georgian),Georgian (Rare),,,,,,,,"Derived from the Ottoman Turkish plural form of the Turkish military title beg meaning ""chieftain, master"".A notable bearer of this name was the Georgian poet Beglar Akhospireli (1880-1921)."
