Belkis,f,,Spanish (Latin American)|Spanish|Spanish (Caribbean),/ˈbel.kis/(Spanish),,,,,,,Spanish borrowing of Bilqis. Bearers of this name include the late Cuban artist Belkis Ayón (1967-1999) and Cuban-American writer Belkis Cuza Malé (1942-).
