Belphegor,m,בַּעַל-פְּעוֹר(Ancient Hebrew),Judeo-Christian-Islamic Legend,bel-FA-gor,,,,,,,"From Ba'al Pe'or, the name of a Semitic god mentioned in the Hebrew Bible, meaning ""Ba'al of Mount Pe'or"" or ""lord of the opening"". In Christian demonology this is the name of a demon that represents the deadly sin of sloth."
