Bethzy,f,,Spanish (Mexican)|Spanish (Latin American)|American (Hispanic),,,,,,,,"Latin American variant of Betsy. This name was brought to public attention by Bethzy Zamorano, a contestant on the Mexican reality television series Bailando por un Sueño. She and her partner, actor/comedian Adrián Uribe, were runner-ups in the first season (2005), which most likely influenced the name's spike in popularity in 2006."
