Bhagatveer,m,ਭਗਤਵੀਰ(Gurmukhi),Punjabi|Indian (Sikh),,,,,,,,"From Punjabi ਭਗਤ (bhagat) meaning ""worshipper, devotee"" (itself from Sanskrit भक्त (bhakta) meaning ""devoted, loyal, faithful"") and Sanskrit वीर (vīra) meaning ""hero, man, brave""."
