Bharani,,भरणी(Sanskrit)|భరణి(Telugu)|பரணி(Tamil),Astronomy|Telugu|Tamil,/ˈbʱɐ.ɾɐ.ɳiː/(Sanskrit)|/ˈbʱa.ɾa.ɳi/(Telugu)|/ˈpɐ.ɾɐ.ɳɪ/(Tamil),,,,,,,"Feminine form of Sanskrit भरण (bharaṇa) meaning ""bearing, maintaining, supporting"". This is the name of the second nakshatra (lunar mansion) in Hindu astronomy, which consists of three stars in the Aries constellation. As a given name it is used for both men and women."
