Bharathy,f,భారతి(Telugu)|ಭಾರತಿ(Kannada)|ഭാരതി(Malayalam)|பாரதி(Tamil),Telugu|Kannada|Malayalam|Tamil,"/ˈbʱaː.ɾa.t̪i/(Telugu)|/ˈbʱaː.ɾɐ.t̪i/(Kannada, Malayalam)|/ˈbaː.ɾɐ.t̪i/(Malayalam)|/ˈbaː.ɾa.ði/(Tamil)",,,,,,,"Alternate transcription of Telugu భారతి, Kannada ಭಾರತಿ, Malayalam ഭാരതി or Tamil பாரதி (see Bharathi)."
