Boccus,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"The King of Media who served the Roman Procurator Lucius.Lucius called upon him to join Rome’s war against Arthur. He led a force of soldiers at the battle of Soissons, where he killed or badly wounded Bedivere, and was slain by Bedivere’s nephew."
