Brand,m,,Dutch|Old Norse|Old Swedish|Old Danish|Norwegian (Rare)|Swedish (Rare),/ˈbrand/(Swedish),,,,,,,"Modern Dutch form of Brando, or a short form of names containing the element brand ""fire, torch, sword"", such as Hildebrand, Rembrandt, or IJsbrand."
