Brannock,m,,History (Ecclesiastical),,,,,,,,"The name of the eponymous saint of the village of Braunton in Devon, England. Saint Brannock (or Brannoc) is said to have originated from South Wales and established a monastery at Braunton in the 6th century. His name may be related to the Welsh Brynach."
