Cafiero,m,,Italian (Rare),,,,,,,,"Transferred use of the surname Cafiero. From an Italian surname derived from Arabic kafir meaning ""infidel"". It was first used as a name in the late 19th century, in honor of Italian anarchist Carlo Cafiero (1846-1892)."
