Caihua,f,"彩花, 彩华, 彩画, 菜花(Chinese)",Chinese,TSIE-KHWAH,,,,,,,"From Chinese 彩 (cǎi) meaning ""colour"" combined with 花 (huā) meaning ""flower, blossom"" or 华 (huá) meaning ""splendid, illustrious, Chinese"", 彩画 (cǎihuà) meaning ""colour painting"", or 菜花 (càihuā) meaning ""cauliflower; rape blossom"". Other character combinations can form this name as well."
