Callirhoe,f,Καλλιρόη(Ancient Greek),Greek Mythology (Latinized),/kə.ˈlɪr.oʊ.iː/,,,,,,,"Latinized form of Greek Καλλιρόη (Kallirhoe), the Epic Greek form of Καλλιρρόη (see Kallirrhoe)."
