Camuel,m,,Biblical|Biblical Latin,,,,,,,,"Form of Kemuel used in the Bishops' Bible (1568), Douay-Rheims Bible (1582-1610), the Clementine Vulgate (1592) and the Nova Vulgata (""Neo-Vulgate"", 1979). The latter two are respectively the former and current official Bible of the Roman Catholic Church."
