Ceithlion,f,,Irish Mythology,,,,,,,,"Ceithlion ((Cethlenn) is a powerful, monstrous queen and prophetess of the Fomorians in Irish mythology. Known by the epithet ""of the Crooked Teeth"" (or Ceithlion Chaisfhiaclach), she is famously recorded as the wife of the monstrous Fomorian king Balor of the Evil Eye and the mother of Ethniu."
