Chakkrit,m,จักรกฤษณ์(Thai),Thai,/t͡ɕak̚˨˩.ˈkrit̚˨˩/,,,,,,,"From Thai จักร (chak) meaning ""wheel, circle, disc"" and ฤษณ์ (krit) referring to the Hindu god Krishna. This is a Thai name for Vishnu."
