Chakor,m,"चकोर(Sanskrit, Hindi, Marathi, Nepali)",Hinduism,chakor,,,,,,,"MEANING : Greek partridge these are fabled to subsist on moonbeamsUsage : Sanskrit, Indian, Tamil, Telugu, Nepali, Sinhalese, Hindi, Sikh, Buddhist, Punjabi, Kannada, Marathi, Gujarati, Assamese, Malayalam, Bengali, Fijian, Hinduism"
