Chauakiah,m,חֲבַקְיָה(Ancient Hebrew),Judeo-Christian-Islamic Legend,,,,,,,,"Possibly means ""praise Yahweh"", derived from Hebrew שָׁבַח (shavaḥ) meaning ""praise, commend"" combined with יָהּ (yah) referring to the Hebrew God. This is the name of an angel belonging to the order of the Powers. He is one of the 72 angels bearing the explicit name of God (the Shem HaMephorash), as interpreted by some Christian Kabbalists."
