Chi-rok,m,치록(Korean Hangul)|致祿(Korean Hanja),Korean (Archaic),,,,,,,,"From Sino-Korean 致 (chi) meaning ""send, deliver, present"" and 祿 (rok) meaning ""blessing, happiness"". Min Chi-rok (1800-1858) was a political figure during the Joseon period."
