Chrystos,,,"English (American, Modern)|Greek (Modern)",/ˈkrɪs.toʊs/(American English),,,,,,,"Variant of Christos. Chrystos, born Christina Smith, is an American writer and activist who self-identifies as two-spirit."
Chrysus,m,Χρυσός(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek (Latinized)|Greek Mythology,,,,,,,,"Means ""gold"" in Ancient Greek."
