Çıner,m,,Turkish,[tʃɯ.nɛr],,,,,,,"A powerful masculine compound of Çın (""Truth/Reality"") and Er (""Man/Hero""). It translates to ""A Man of Truth,"" ""A Real Man,"" or ""One who resonates with the ultimate reality."" This name is a badge of integrity, signifying a person whose character is fundamentally grounded in honesty, strength, and unwavering principles. It is the antithesis of deception."
