Cipactonal,m,,Aztec and Toltec Mythology,,,,,,,,"An Aztec deity, god of astrology and calendars. He and his wife, Oxomoco, were known as the first human couple. Derived from Nahuatl cipactli ""crocodile, alligator, caiman; crocodilian monster, dragon"", with the second element possibly being tonalli ""day, sun, heat; day-sign; soul, fate""."
