Cobie,,,English,/ˈko.bi/,,,,,,,"Diminutive of Jacob or Jacoba.A noted bearer is Canadian actress and model Cobie Smulders, born Jacoba Francisca Maria Smulders (b.1982); best known for her roles as Robin Scherbatsky on the television series 'How I Met Your Mother' and Maria Hill in the Marvel Cinematic Universe."
Cobina,f,,English (Rare),,,,,,,,Presumably a short form of Jacobina.
Coblaith,f,,Medieval Irish|Pictish,,,,,,,,"Believed to mean ""victorious sovereignty"", from Old Irish cob ""victory"" and flaith ""ruler, sovereign, princess"". This name was relatively common in the early Irish period. It was also the name of a 7th century Pictish princess."
