Cooter,m,,American (Rare),KOO-tər,,,,,,,"Possibly from the surname Cooter originating in Sussex, England. The American nickname became widely known in the United States with the character Cooter Davenport on the television series 'The Dukes of Hazzard' (1979-1985). The name was more recently used for the character Cooter Menkins in the television series 'Glee' (2009-2015)."
