Cura,f,,Roman Mythology,,,,,,,,"Cura or Aera Cura is the name of a Roman goddess who created the first human. In Latin. Hyginus seems to have created both the personification and story for his Fabulae, poem 220. The name itself is derived from Latin cura ""care, concern, thought""."
