Cyaxares,m,Κυαξάρης(Greek),Old Persian (Latinized)|History,/cy.ak.ˈsa.ris/(Koine Greek)|/ci.ak.ˈsa.ris/(Constantinopolitan Greek)|[ky.ˈak.sa.reːs](Classical Latin)|[t͡ʃi.ˈak.sa.res](modern Ecclesiastical Latin),,,,,,,"Latinized form of Greek Κυαξάρης (Kyaxares), which is the hellenized form of either the Old Persian name Uvaxštra or its Old Median form Huvaxšarah. This was the name of a Median king from the 6th century BC."
