Cymande,m,,American (Rare),si-man-day,,,,,,,From the name of the eponymous band consisting of Caribbean musicians living in London.The band name was derived from the chorus line of the calypso song 'dove and pigeon' coo-coo-coo-coo-fan-cy-mandy.
