Cymbria,f,,"English (Modern, Rare)",SIM-bree-a,,,,,,,Not available.
Cymburgis,f,,Medieval Polish (Germanized),,,,,,,,"Cymburgis of Masovia was a Polish princess and a Duchess of Austria through her marriage with the Habsburg duke Ernst der Eiserne (Ernest the iron-willed). Her father was duke Siemowit IV and her mother was Aleksandra, the youngest daughter of Algirdas, Grand Duke of Lithuania."
Cyme,f,,Kosovar,,,,,,,,Not available.
