Cyricus,m,,Late Greek (Latinized),,,,,,,,"Latinized form of the Late Greek given name Kerykos (see Kirykos) via a corruption that was caused by the name's similarity to names like Kyriakos and Kyrikos.This name is best known for being the name of a 4th-century child martyr and saint from Asia Minor, who was murdered together with his mother Julitta."
