Darchia,m,დარჩია(Georgian),Georgian (Archaic),,,,,,,,"Either a diminutive or a variant of დარჩილ (Darchil), which is the Georgian form of the Middle Persian name Dartsihr (see Dachi).This name is archaic and now only survives in the patronymic surnames of დარჩია (Darchia) and დარჩიაშვილი (Darchiashvili) meaning ""child of Darchia""."
