Darvydas,m,,Lithuanian,,,,,,,,"Basically means ""working to see"", derived from Lithuanian daryti meaning ""to do, to act"" as well as ""to work"" combined with Baltic vyd meaning ""to see"" (see Vytautas). Also compare other names that end in -vydas, such as Alvydas and Tautvydas.A known bearer of this name is the Lithuanian professional soccer player Darvydas Šernas (b. 1984)."
