Dastan,m,"داستان(Persian, Kazakh Arabic)|Дастан(Kazakh, Kyrgyz)",Persian Mythology|Kazakh|Kyrgyz|Kurdish,/d̪ɒːs.ˈt̪ʰɒːn/(Persian)|/dɑs.ˈtɑn/(Kazakh),,,,,,,"Means ""story, legend"" in Persian. This is another name for Zal, a character in the Shahnameh epic."
