Dedoslav,m,,Medieval Slavic,,,,,,,,"The first element of this name is probably derived from Old Church Slavonic dědŭ ""grandfather"", which is ultimately derived from Proto-Slavic dědъ ""grandfather"". The second element is derived from Slavic slav ""glory"". As such, the meaning of this name would roughly be ""grandfather of glory""."
