Demoleus,m,,Greek Mythology (Latinized),,,,,,,,"Uncertain etymology, possibly an altered form of Demoleon. This was the name of an Achaean warrior who participated in the Trojan War according to the Aeneid. During the siege of Troy, he was slain by the hero Aeneas, and his armour used as a prize in a later competition."
