Deunoro,m,,Basque,,,,,,,,"Coined by Sabino Arana Goiri and Koldo Elizalde who based the name on Basque deun ""holy, sacred; Saint"" and oro ""all"". This name was intended as a Basque equivalent of Toussaint and Santos (which is used in reference to the Día de Todos los Santos)."
