Dhondup,,"དོན་གྲུབ(Tibetan, Dzongkha)",Tibetan,,,,,,,,"From Tibetan དོན་གྲུབ (don 'grub) meaning ""one who has accomplished a goal"", derived from དོན (don) meaning ""object, purpose, goal"" and གྲུབ ('grub) meaning ""accomplish, achieve, fufill"". This is one of the names of the 14th Dalai Lama, Tenzin Gyatso (1935-), who was born Lhamo Dhondup."
