Dietleib,m,,German,,,,,,,,"The name is made up of the name elements diot meaning ""people"" and #leiba"" meaning ""inheritance"". A more popular variation of this name is Detlef.Dietleib the hero from the Middle High German heroic epic Biterolf und Dietleib, plays an important role as a companion of Dietrich of Bern in the Thidrekssaga and in the legend of King Laurin's Rose Garden."
