Dilivio,m,,"Afrikaans (Rare)|Dutch (Surinamese, Rare)",,,,,,,,"Since this name is also found written as Di Livio, it is probably a combination of the Italian preposition di meaning ""of"" with the given name Livio. As a result, the meaning of this name would literally be ""of Livio"".Known bearers of this name include the South African cricketer Dilivio Ridgaard (b. 1997), the Dutch soccer player Di Livio Jungschleger (b. 1997) and Gondilio ""Bolle"" Lowland (1999-2018), a Dutch rapper of Surinamese descent who bore Dilivio as a middle name."
