Dolgormaa,f,Долгормаа(Mongolian Cyrillic),Mongolian,,,,,,,,Combination of the name Dolgor and the Mongolian feminine suffix маа (maa).
Dolgorsüren,f,Долгорсүрэн(Mongolian Cyrillic)|ᠳᠣᠯᠭᠣᠷᠰᠦᠷᠡᠨ(Traditional Mongolian),Mongolian,[tɔɬ.ɢɔ̆r̥.su.rɘ̆ŋ],,,,,,,"Means ""White Tara's protection"" in Mongolian, ultimately from Tibetan སྒྲོལ་དཀར་ (sgrol-dkar) referring to the White Tara in Buddhism, symbolizing compassion, healing, and longevity, and སྲུང་འཁོར (srung-khor) meaning ""amulet, talisman, protective charm."""
