Dori-mu,,"夢, 童莉夢, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,DO-ṘEE-MUU,,,,,,,"From Japanese 夢 (dori-mu) meaning ""dream"", 童 (do) meaning ""juvenile, child"", 莉 (ri) meaning ""pear"" combined with 夢 (mu) meaning ""dream"". Other kanji or kanji combinations can form this name as well.Usage of this name is, most likely, influenced by the word dream."
