Drusiana,f,,"Ancient Roman|Italian (Rare, Archaic)|Gnosticism",,,,,,,,Feminine form of Drusianus. The tale of the resurrection of Drusiana features prominently in the Acts of John.
Drusiane,f,,Gnosticism,,,,,,,,French form of Drusiana.
