Dulceflur,f,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"A princess of Trefferin and Karedonas whose father, King Gediens, was slain by the heathen King Verangoz of Sorboreste.Her lands were saved by Meleranz, Arthur’s nephew, who later married her cousin, Tydomie. At Meleranz’s recommendation, Dulceflur was wed to King Libers of Lorgan."
