Dyonis,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"Brother of Alibel, Dion, and Casibilant, and nephew of Duke Calles.His six cousins revolted against their father. Dyonis and his brothers assisted Calles in the war, in which they were joined by Agravain, Gaheris, and Gareth."
Dyonise,f,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"A lady who ruled the Castle of Ten Maidens with her lover, Sir Geogenant. Dyonise and Geogenant were friends of Sir Durmart."
