Eadburh,f,,Anglo-Saxon,,,,,,,,"Variant of Eadburg. Also compare Wilburg versus Wilburh.A notable bearer of this name is Eadburh of Winchester, a daughter of the 10th-century Anglo-Saxon king Edward the Elder. She was canonized 12 years after her death."
