Ecolo,m,エコロ(Japanese Katakana),Popular Culture,Ekolo,,,,,,,"The exact origin of this name is unclear, though it could come from 心 (kokoro; heart). It could also be derived from コロコロ (corocoro; roughly a fat , bouncy, spherical object).Likely coincidentally, “Écolo” means “eco-freak” (someone who is zealous on saving the environment) in French.This name is born by Puyo Puyo character Ecolo."
