Eiichirou,m,"栄一郎, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,E:-EE-EE-CHEE-ṘO:,,,,,,,"From Japanese 栄 (ei) meaning ""glory, honor"", 一 (ichi) meaning ""one"" combined with 郎 (rou) meaning ""son"". Other combinations of kanji characters are also possible.A famous bearer of this name is Japanese manga artist Eiichiro Oda. He is best known for his manga series One Piece (1997–present)."
