Eilífur,m,,Old Norse,,,,,,,,"Eilífur örn Atlason (c. 880) was a viking explorer and Norwegian colonist who founded a settlement in Skagafjörður, Iceland. There is debate surrounding where specifically he settled. He is mentioned in Ljósvetninga saga, Njáls saga, and Kristni saga."
