Elbereth,f,,Literature,,,,,,,,"Means ""queen of the stars"" in Sindarin, composed of êl ""star"" and bereth ""queen, spouse"". In 'The Lord of the Rings' (1954) by J. R. R. Tolkien, this was an epithet of Varda, the deity to whom the Elvish hymn 'A Elbereth Gilthoniel' was directed."
