Eldacar,m,,Literature,,,,,,,,"Means ""elf helmet"" in Quenya. This is the name of the twenty-first king of Gondor in Tolkien's legendarium. Eldacar is the son of Valacar and Vidumavi. He is deposed by his wicked cousin Castamir, and later raises an army to defeat Castamir and reclaim his throne."
