Elgiz,,,Azerbaijani|Turkish (Rare),,,,,,,,"Possibly derived in part from Turkic el meaning ""country, society"". This name is masculine in Azerbaijani and feminine in Turkish."
Elgiza,f,Эльгиза(Kyrgyz),Kyrgyz,,,,,,,,"Means ""daughter of the people"", derived from Turkic el meaning ""people, country, nation"" combined with кыз (kız) ""girl, daughter""."
