Eliathah,m,אֱלִיאָ֫תָה(Hebrew),Biblical|Hebrew,,,,,,,,"Means ""God comes (to him)"" or ""to whom God will come"", derived from Hebrew el ""God"" and atháh ""to come, to bring"". In the bible, this was the name of one of the many sons of Heman the Levite."
