Elien,f,,Dutch|American,ay-LEEN(Dutch),,,,,,,"Dutch form of Eline, with its spelling phonetical in nature. A known bearer of this name is Elien Meijer (b. 1970), a retired Dutch rower who won a silver medal at the 2000 Summer Olympics in Sydney. Although it should be noted that in her case, the name is short for Elsiena."
