Eliezier,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"The son of King Pelles of Corbenic, brother of Elaine and maternal uncle of Galahad.As a youth, Eliezier left his homeland, Listenois, for Logres, to help in King Arthur’s struggle against the invading Saxons. He joined a party of youths led by Gawaine. Eliezier served as Gawaine’s squire and he barks at taking Gawaine’s challenge to Lancelot in the war of vengeance for the deaths of Gawaine and Gaheris."
