Elyar,m,Эльяр(Kazakh)|Эляр(Kyrgyz),Azerbaijani|Kazakh|Kyrgyz (Rare),,,,,,,,"Derived from Old Turkic el meaning ""country, state, society"" (see Eldar) combined with the Persian noun یار (yar) meaning ""friend, companion"" as well as ""assistant, helper"".A notable bearer of this name is the Azerbaijani pop singer Elyar Afshari (b. 1995), who is better known under the mononym Elyar."
