Elysant,f,,Medieval,,,,,,,,"The name Elysant is girl's name meaning ""temple path"". An intriguing medieval name found in various forms across Europe. Variants include Elisende, Elisenda, Elysande, Elisent and Helisent. It likely derives from a Visigothic name meaning ""temple path""."
