Erabella,f,,English (Rare),ar-ə-BEL-ə|ayr-ə-BEL-ə,,,,,,,Variant of Arabella.
Erabelle,f,,English (Rare),,,,,,,,Variant of Arabelle.
Erachar,m,,Germanic,,,,,,,,"Derived from Old High German êra ""honour, respect"" combined with Old High German wachar ""vigilant."" The second element might also be derived from Old High German hari ""army."""
