Eren,f,"えれん(Japanese Hiragana)|エレン(Japanese Katakana)|愛恋, 愛蓮, 依蓮, 栄恋, 瑛恋, 英連, 会恋, 絵連, 江蓮, 惠蓮, etc.(Japanese Kanji)","Japanese (Modern, Rare)|Kurdish|Albanian (Rare)|Bosnian (Rare)",E-REN|EHR-EHN,,,,,,,"From Japanese 愛 (e) meaning ""love, affection"" combined with 恋 (ren) meaning ""love"". Other kanji combinations are possible.Usage of this name is most likely influenced by the name Ellen 1."
