Eréndira,f,,Purépecha|Spanish (Mexican),,,,,,,,"Derived from P'urhépecha iréndira meaning ""the one who smiles"" or ""smiling, cheerful"".Notable bearers of this name include the 16th-century princess Eréndira of the P'urhépecha people and the Mexican actress Eréndira Ibarra (b. 1985)."
