Eridanos,m,Ηριδανος(Ancient Greek),Greek Mythology,,,,,,,,"From the name of a River-God of the mythical northern land of Hyperborea. He was also the god of the constellation Eridanus. The river's name may mean ""early burnt"" from the elements eri and danos and refer to the myth of Phaethon."
