Erkinbek,m,Эркинбек(Kyrgyz)|Еркінбек(Kazakh)|ەركىنبەك(Kazakh Arabic),Kyrgyz|Kazakh,,,,,,,,"From Kyrgyz эркин (erkin) or Kazakh еркін (erkin) meaning ""free"" and the Turkish military title beg meaning ""chieftain, master""."
