Eubuleus,m,Εὐβουλεύς(Ancient Greek),Greek Mythology,,,,,,,,"Latinized form of Εὐβουλεύς (Eubouleus) meaning ""of good counsel"" in Ancient Greek (see Euboulos). In ancient Greek mythology and religion, Eubuleus was a god associated with mystery cults."
