Eugeen,m,,Dutch (Rare)|Flemish (Rare),,,,,,,,"Dutch form of Eugenius (see Eugene). Known bearers of this name include the Belgian painter Eugeen Van Mieghem (1875-1930) and the Belgian doctor, poet and playwright Eugeen van Oye (1840-1926)."
