Finette,f,,Literature|Folklore|Haitian Creole,,,,,,,,"This is the main character in the French fairy tale Finette Cendron by Madame d'Aulnoy, about a clever girl named Fine-Oreille, which means ""sharp ear"" or ""delicate ear"", who is called Finette. It is said to mean ""little cunning girl""."
