Florabel,f,,English (Rare)|Filipino,FLAWR-ə-bel(English),,,,,,,"Variant of Florabelle, a combination of Flora and Belle. A well-known bearer was the American reporter, newspaper columnist and author Florabel Muir (1889-1970), who covered both Hollywood celebrities and underworld gangsters from the 1920s through the 1960s."
Florabelle,f,,"English (American, Rare)",,,,,,,,Combination of Flora and Belle.
Florabeth,f,,"Spanish (Caribbean)|Filipino (Modern, Rare)|English (Rare, ?)",,,,,,,,Variant of Floribeth or a combination of Flora and Beth.
