Fransje,,,Dutch,/ˈfrɑn.ʃə/,,,,,,,"When borne by a female person, this name is a good example of how one can turn a very masculine name (Frans) into a feminine name by simply adding the diminutive suffix -je to the original name. But when borne by a male person, this name is simply a pet form because of the diminutive suffix."
