Fumiyoshi,m,"文吉, 文義, 文良, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,FOO-MEE-YO-SHEE,,,,,,,"This name is used as 文 (fumi) ""writing"" combined with 吉 (yoshi) meaning ""good luck"", 義 (yoshi) meaning ""righteous"", or 良 (yoshi) meaning ""good, virtuous, respectable"". Other kanji combinations can be used."
