Fula-ngenge,m,,Kongo,foo·luh - en·gen·gay,,,,,,,"1) ""one who is chosen by GOD to control the destiny of those who are less fortunate"" in Lingala2) “one that blows happiness onto those who suffer” in Lingala*LINGALA is the main lingua franca of northern Democratic Republic of Congo, and it is also heard in other regions of the DRC and ANGOLA as well as in other countries that border the DRC."
