Fuyan,f,"芙焰, 芙燕(Chinese)",Chinese,,,,,,,,"From the Chinese 芙 (fú) meaning ""hibiscus"" and 焰 (yàn) meaning ""flame, blaze; glowing"" or 燕 (yàn) meaning ""swallow (bird)""."
Fuying,f,"馥莺, 馥瑛, 芙樱(Chinese)",Chinese,,,,,,,,"From the Chinese 馥 (fù) meaning ""fragrance, aroma"" or 芙 (fú) meaning ""hibiscus"" and 莺 (yīng) meaning ""oriole, green finch"", 瑛 (yīng) meaning ""luster of gems, crystal"" or 樱 (yīng) meaning ""cherry, cherry blossom""."
