Gaara,m,我愛羅(Japanese Kanji)|があら(Japanese Hiragana),Popular Culture,GAH:-ṘAH(Japanese),,,,,,,"Gaara is a main character in the famous manga and anime 'Naruto'. His name derives from kanji 我 (ga) meaning ""I, me, oneself"", 愛 (a) meaning ""affection, favourite, love"" and 羅 (ra) meaning ""thin silk; gauze"". These kanji are strickly linked with the character's look and story."
