Gagul,m,,Biblical Hebrew,,,,,,,,"In bible, there was a place called ""Mountain of skulls"" In biblical hebrew it was called ""Golgotha"". Eventually as times passed Golgotha turned into ""Gagul"" when people prounced it. ""Gagul"" Is a very uncommon name, But you can find people named ""Gagul"" in Armenia. and it is also found amoung Christian South indians espically the state of Kerala,Goa."
