Galbart,m,,Literature,,,,,,,,"Created by author George R. R. Martin for a character in his series 'A Song of Ice and Fire'. It is possibly derived from Gilbert. In the series, Galbart Glover is the Lord of Deepwood Motte and a vassal of House Stark."
Galbatorix,m,,Literature,,,,,,,,Galbatorix is the primary antagonist of Christopher Paolini's Inheritance Trilogy. He is an immensely powerful Dragon Rider and the king of a large portion of AlagaÃ«sia.
