Galleria,f,,Literature,gal-ə-REE-ə,,,,,,,"Used by American author Deborah Gregory for a character in her 'Cheetah Girls' series of books, first released in 1999. It was possibly inspired by the English vocabulary word (which refers to ""a central court through several storeys of a shopping centre or department store onto which shops or departments open at each level"")."
