Gamlet,m,Гамлет(Russian)|Համլետ(Armenian)|ჰამლეტ(Georgian),Russian|Armenian|Georgian,,,,,,,,"Russian form of Hamlet. Armenians and Georgians who are proficient in Russian will sometimes use this form to transcribe Համլետ (Hamlet) and ჰამლეტ (Hamlet). This is not surprising, since their countries were formerly part of the Soviet Union.A known bearer of this name is the Russian former soccer player Gamlet Siukayev (b. 1981)."
