Gangalando,m,,Medieval Italian,,,,,,,,"Italian form of a Germanic given name that consisted of the Germanic elements gang meaning ""path"" (see Wolfgang) and land meaning ""land.""A known bearer of this name was the Italian military man Gangalando Bertucci di Guiglia (died in 1327 AD)."
Gangam,m,,Indian,,,,,,,,Masculine form of Gangama.
