Geeldoon,m,,Somali,,,,,,,,"Geeldoon is a Somali name with the following characteristics:Meaning: The name Geeldoon typically means ""one who seeks wealth"" or ""one who desires abundance.""Origin: It is derived from Somali, where ""geel"" means ""camel"" and ""doon"" means ""to seek"" or ""to desire."" In Somali culture, camels are traditionally associated with wealth and prosperity, so the name reflects a desire for success and abundance."
