Genubath,m,גנבת(Ancient Hebrew),Biblical,,,,,,,,"Genubath, meaning ""Stolen,"" is mentioned in I Kings 11:20 as the son born to Hadad the Edomite and the sister of Queen Tahpenes, Pharaoh's wife."
