Gissur,m,,Icelandic|Faroese|Old Norse,[ˈcɪsː.ˌʏːr̥](Icelandic),,,,,,,"Uncertain etymology, possibly derived from Old Norse giss ""guess"" and either the suffix -ur or svar ""answer, reply"". Alternatively, it could derive from the name *Gísrøðr (see Geirrøðr), or perhaps be related to Gísli."
