Gladiola,f,,"English (Rare)|Albanian (Rare)|Romanian (Rare)|Spanish (Latin American, Rare)|Spanish (Mexican, Rare)|Filipino (Rare)",glad-ee-O-lə(English),,,,,,,"From the name of the flowering plant gladiolus, literally meaning ""small sword"" from Latin gladius ""sword"" (a reference to its sword-shaped leaves). Gladiola Josephine ""Glady Joe"" is a character in the novel 'How to Make an American Quilt' (1991) and subsequent film adaptation (1995)."
