Goedele,f,,Flemish|Dutch (Rare),GHOO-də-lə(Flemish)|KHOO-də-lə(Dutch),,,,,,,"Dutch form of Gudula. These days it is primarily used in Flanders, which is the Dutch-speaking part of Belgium.A notable bearer of this name is the Flemish psychologist and sexologist Goedele Liekens (b. 1963), who has authored several books and has also long been active as a radio host and television presenter."
