Gohan,m,悟飯(Japanese Kanji),Popular Culture,,,,,,,,"Means ""cooked rice"". From the Japanese gohan (ご飯) meaning 'cooked rice' or 'meal of any sort'.Gohan is one of the protagonists in the Japanese manga 'Dragon Ball' by Akira Toriyama. He also appears in the television anime series of the same name."
