Gojislava,f,"Гојислава(Serbian, Croatian Cyrillic, Montenegrin)","Medieval Serbian|Serbian (Rare, ?)|Croatian|Montenegrin (Rare, ?)","ɡɔjiˈslaʋa(Medieval Serbian)|ɡɔjiˈslava(Serbian, Croatian, Montenegrin)",,,,,,,"Gojislava is a medieval Serbian name coming from the medieval Serbian word ""goji"", meaning 'to nurture' or 'to heal'. Today it is rarely used, and is mostly used by Serbs or Montenegrins. In recent years, the name has actually surged relatively in Croatia among newer generations due to a popular revitalization of medieval names."
