Golan,m,גולן(Hebrew),Hebrew,go-LAHN,,,,,,,"From the name of the Golan Heights, a region (currently) in the north of Israel. Originally used as a place name in the Bible.This name was in the top 50 in Israel in 1973-4, so its usage is probably related to the Yom Kippur War that took place during those years."
