Goodluck,m,,English (African),,,,,,,,"From the English phrase good luck, a term for desirable or beneficial fortune, or a phrase used to wish fortune on someone. Currently, the name is most common in parts of English-influenced Africa. A famous bearer of the name is Nigerian President Goodluck Jonathan (1957-)."
