Gorōta,m,"五郎太, 吾郎太, 五朗太, 吾朗太(Japanese Kanji)|ごろうた(Japanese Hiragana)|ゴロウタ(Japanese Katakana)",Japanese (Rare),GO-ṘO:-TAH,,,,,,,"This name combines 五 (go, itsu, itsu.tsu) meaning ""five"" or 吾 (go, a-, waga-, ware) meaning ""I, my, one's own"" & 郎 (ryou, rou, otoko) meaning ""son"" or 朗 (rou, aki.raka, hoga.raka) meaning ""bright, cheerful, clear, merry"" with 太 (ta, tai, futo.i, futo.ru) meaning ""big, plump, thick.""This name is very rarely given to boys, if given at all."
