Guangxin,,"光新, 光信, 广信, 广鑫, 广欣, etc.(Chinese)|光新, 光信, 廣信, 廣鑫, 廣欣, etc.(Traditional Chinese)",Chinese,/kwaŋ.ɕin/,,,,,,,"From Chinese 光 (guāng) meaning ""light, brilliant, shine"" or 广 (guǎng) meaning ""broad, wide, extensive"" combined with 新 (xīn) meaning ""fresh, new"", 信 (xìn) meaning ""trust, believe"", 鑫 (xīn) meaning ""wealthy, prosperous"" or 欣 (xīn) meaning ""happy, joyous, delighted"". Other character combinations can form this name as well."
