Guidobaldo,m,,Medieval Italian,,,,,,,,"Italian form of Witbald. There have also been cases where the name is a combination of Guido with Ubaldo.Known bearers of this name include the Italian military leader Guidobaldo da Montefeltro (1472-1508), the Italian poet Guidobaldo Bonarelli (1563-1608) and Guidobaldo del Monte (1545-1607), an Italian mathematician, philosopher and astronomer."
