Gumbrecht,m,,"German (Rare, Archaic)|Jewish (Ashkenazi, Archaic)",GUWM-brekht,,,,,,,"A dithematic name formed from the Germanic name elements gunda ""war"" and beraht ""bright"".Jewish usage of this name and related forms started in the Duchy of Jülich and spread from there, it seems to be associated with the Jewish names Ephraim and Mardochai. The reason for that is unknown."
