Gunda,f,Гунда(Abkhaz),Abkhaz,/ˈɡun.də/(Russian),,,,,,,"Possibly means ""beautiful"" in Abkhaz. Alternately, it may be a form of the Ossetian name Agunda. This is the name of a legendary Abkhaz woman who could take the form of a white horse."
