Guust,m,,Dutch|Literature,/ˈɣyst/(Dutch),,,,,,,"Short form of Auguust, Augustinus and Gustaaf (also found spelled as Guustaaf).In literature, the protagonist of the Franco-Belgian comic Gaston (1957-current) is known as Guust Flater in the Dutch translations, which are primarily popular in Flanders (rather than the Netherlands)."
