Gvira,f,גְּבִירָה(Hebrew),Hebrew (Rare),,,,,,,,"Modern Hebrew name meaning ""lady, mistress"" (identical to the biblical title גְּבִירָה (gebirah), which suggested female royal power, and ultimately relates to the first element in Gabriel)."
