Gyeong-a,f,"경아(Korean Hangul)|景雅, 暻娥, etc.(Korean Hanja)",Korean,/kjʌŋ.a/,,,,,,,"From Sino-Korean 景 (gyeong) meaning ""scenery, view"" or 暻 (gyeong) meaning ""bright"" combined with 雅 (a) meaning ""elegant, graceful, refined"" or 娥 (a) meaning ""good, beautiful"". Other hanja combinations can form this name as well."
