Gylan,m,,English (American),GIL-LAN(American English),,,,,,,"Variation of given name Gillen, a Basque form of William meaning willo ""will, desire"" and helm ""protection"". Or a variation of Irish surname Gillen (Ó Giolláin) from giolla meaning ""lad"". Gylan Kain (Frank Gillen Oates) was an American poet and playwright."
