Gylli,m,ᚴᛁᚢᛚᛁ(Norse Runes),Old Norse,,,,,,,,"Meaning uncertain. Perhaps a short form of names starting with guð ""god"". Found on a runestone as kiuli, though that might actually be another Old Norse name (Kiúli)."
