Gyokko,,"玉壼, 玉子(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,Gee-yo-koh,,,,,,,"From Gyo meaning “Jade” (玉) and Kko meaning “Pot” (壼). Can be read as “Jade pot” or other kanji combinations like “Jade child” from using 子 can be read.This name is known most popularly from an anime character in Demon Slayer, see Managi for his original name."
