Gyu-dam,,"규담(Korean Hangul)|奎潭, 圭潭, etc.(Korean Hanja)",Korean,/kju.däm/,,,,,,,"Combination of a gyu hanja, like 奎 meaning ""star; sentence, writing; stride"" or 圭 meaning ""auspicious jewel; hall,"" and a dam hanja, e.g. 潭 meaning ""deep pool; marsh, puddle."""
