Gyu-hyeon,m,규현(Korean Hangul),Korean,GYOO-HYUN,,,,,,,"From Sino-Korean 圭 ""jade pointed at top"" and 賢 ""virtuous, worthy, good"". A famous bearer is South Korean singer Cho Kyu-hyun (1988-)."
