Haamiah,m,הַעַמִּיָּה(Ancient Hebrew),Judeo-Christian-Islamic Legend,,,,,,,,"Possibly means ""the nation of Yahweh"", from the Hebrew definite article הַ (ha) combined with עַם (ʿam) meaning ""people, nation"" and יָהּ (yah) referring to the Hebrew God. This is the name of an angel belonging to the order of the Powers. He is one of the 72 angels bearing the explicit name of God (the Shem HaMephorash), as interpreted by some Christian Kabbalists."
