Haato,m,"はあと(Japanese Hiragana)|ハ アト(Japanese Katakana)|心, 強, 温, 遥亜登, 覇愛騰, 玻杏東, 羽彩土, 波阿止, etc.(Japanese Kanji)","Japanese (Modern, Rare)",HA-TO,,,,,,,"Usage of this name is influenced by the English word ""heart"". It can be spelled with kanji that are related to kindness or strength of the heart, such as 温 or 強. It can also be spelled with 遥 (ha) meaning ""distant, far away"", 愛 (a) meaning ""love, affection"" and 登 (to) meaning ""to ascent"". Other spellings are possible."
