Habron,m,"῞Αβρων, Ἅβρων(Ancient Greek)",Ancient Greek,,,,,,,,"Ancient Greek name, apparently derived from Greek ἁβρός (habros) which meant ""graceful, delicate, pretty"". (Compare the first element in Abrocomas.)"
