Hakuryū,m,"博龍, 博竜, 博隆, 白竜, 白龍, 白隆, 伯龍, 伯竜, 伯隆, 柏龍(Japanese Kanji)|はくりゅう(Japanese Hiragana)|ハクリュウ(Japanese Katakana)",Japanese (Rare),HAH-KUU-ṘYUU:,,,,,,,"This name can be used as 博龍, 博竜, 博隆, 白竜, 白龍, 白隆, 伯龍, 伯竜, 伯隆 or 柏龍 with 博 (haku, baku) meaning ""command, esteem, exposition, fair, win acclaim,"" 白 (haku, byaku, shira-, shiro, shiro.i) meaning ""white,"" 伯 (haku) meaning ""Brazil, chief, count, earl, uncle,"" 柏 (haku, hyaku, byaku, kashiwa) meaning ""oak,"" 龍 (ryuu, ryou, rou, tatsu) meaning ""dragon, imperial,"" 竜 (ryuu, ryou, rou, ise, tatsu) meaning ""dragon, imperial"" and 隆 (ryuu) meaning ""high, hump, noble, prosperity.""Hakuryū (白竜) is also a word meaning ""white dragon.""This name is very rarely given to boys, if given at all.Hakuryū (白竜) is also used as a surname."
