Hanari,f,"花凛, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,,,,,,,,"From Japanese 花 (hana) meaning ""flower"" combined with 凛 (ri) meaning ""dignified, severe, cold"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
