Hanaru,f,"葉成, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,HAH-NAH-ṘUU,,,,,,,"From Japanese 葉 (ha) meaning ""leaf"" combined with 成 (naru) meaning ""to become"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
