Hanazuki,f,,Japanese,HA-NAH-SUU-KEE,,,,,,,"From Japanese, 花好き(Hana-suki) means ""Flower lover"" combining 花 (hana) meaning ""flower"" and 好き (suki) meaning ""like"" or ""love"" This name is used on a fictional character in the animated web series ""Hanazuki: Full of Treasures"""
