Haneko,f,"葉根子, 羽子, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese (Rare),HAH-NEH-KO,,,,,,,"From the Japanese elements 羽 (hane) meaning ""feather, plume"", and 子 (ko) meaning ""child, sign of the rat"". Other kanji combinations can spell this name."
