Hanhui,,"汉辉, 瀚辉, 涵慧, 菡慧, 汉晖, etc.(Chinese)|漢輝, 瀚輝, 涵慧, 菡慧, 汉暉, etc.(Traditional Chinese)",Chinese,/xan.xweɪ̯/,,,,,,,"From Chinese 汉 (hàn) meaning ""man"" and also referring to the Han Chinese people, 瀚 (hàn) meaning ""vast, wide, extensive"", 涵 (hán) meaning ""to contain, to include"" or 菡 (hàn) meaning ""lotus flower"" combined with 辉 (huī) meaning ""brightness"", 慧 (huì) meaning ""bright, intelligent"" or 晖 (huī) meaning ""sunlight, sunshine"". Other character combinations can form this name as well."
