Haresh,m,हरेश(Hindi),Indian,,,,,,,,"Name Haresh generally means Lord Krishna or Lord Shiva, is of Indian origin, Name Haresh is a Masculine (or Boy) name. Person with name Haresh are mainly Hindu by religion. Name Haresh belongs to rashi Kark (Cancer) with dominant planet Moon (Chandra) and Nakshatra (stars) Punarvasu."
Hareta,m,"晴太, 晴田, 晴他(Japanese Kanji)|はれた(Japanese Hiragana)|ハレタ(Japanese Katakana)",Japanese,HA-RE-TA,,,,,,,"From Japanese 晴 (hare) meaning ""clear weather, sunny"" combined with 太 (ta) meaning ""big, thick"", 田 (ta) meaning ""rice field"", or 他 (ta) meaning ""other"". Other kanji or kanji combinations can form this name as well. This name can also come from Japanese 晴れた (hareta) meaning ""cleared up, has become clear/sunny"". One fictional bearer of this name is Hareta (ハレタ), the protagonist of the manga Pokémon Diamond and Pearl Adventure."
Harete,f,,Māori,hah-reh-teh,,,,,,,Māori form of Charlotte. A notable bearer of this name is the Māori politician Harete Hipango (born c. 1964) from New Zealand.
