Haridhos,m,,Hinduism,,,,,,,,"Swami Haridhos Giri played a pivotal role in popularizing Dakshina Sampradaya Namasankeertanam, traveling widely to deliver speeches and sing bhajans. As the chief disciple of Swami Gnanananda Giri, he devoted his life to serving his guru. In just 14 years, he established a spiritual haven in Thennangur–Dakshina Halasyam, building the Panduranga Temple dedicated to Vitthala, a shrine for his guru, and accommodations for devotees."
