Hatoko,f,"鳩子, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,HAH-TO-KO,,,,,,,"From Japanese 鳩 (hato) meaning ""dove, pigeon"" and 子 (ko) meaning ""child"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
