Havalina,f,,Popular Culture,,,,,,,,Not available.
Havam,m,,History,,,,,,,,Meaning uncertain. This was the name of a king of Haripuñjaya (located in what is now Northern Thailand).
Havana,f,,English (Modern),/hə.ˈvæn.ə/,,,,,,,"From the name of the capital city of Cuba (see Havana). The 2017 song Havana by Cuban-American singer Camila Cabello caused this name to gain some popularity, along with its similarity in sound to Savannah."
