Helenio,m,,Spanish (Rare),/e.ˈle.njo/,,,,,,,Spanish form of Helenius.
Helenita,f,,Portuguese (Brazilian)|Spanish (Philippines),,,,,,,,Diminutive of Helena.
Helenius,m,,Ancient Roman (Rare),,,,,,,,Variant of Helenus. This is the name of 3rd century AD Roman grammarian and commentator Helenius Acron.
