Helgar,m,,Norwegian (Rare)|Swedish (Rare),,,,,,,,Variant of Helge.
Helgard,f,,German (Rare),HEL-gard,,,,,,,Probably a blend of Helga with a name ending in -gard.The artist Helgard Haug is a member of Rimini Protokoll.
Helgarda,f,,Polish (Rare),,,,,,,,Form of Helgard. Last year it was borne by 13 women in Poland.
Helgaud,m,,Medieval French,,,,,,,,Not available.
