Heyi,,"和谊, 和儀, 何一, etc.(Chinese)",Chinese,/xɤ.i/,,,,,,,"From Chinese 和 (hé) meaning ""harmony peace"" or 何 (hé) meaning ""river, stream"" and 谊 (yì) meaning ""friendship"", 儀 (yí) meaning ""ceremony, rites"", or 一 (yī) meaning ""one"". Other character combinations can also form this name."
