Hezhi,,"和枝, 和智, 和志, 和直, 河枝, 河智, 河志, 河直, 荷枝, 荷智, 荷志, 荷直, 合枝, 合智, 合志, 合直, 鹤枝, 鹤智, 鹤志, 鹤直, etc.(Chinese)",Chinese,HU-CHEE,,,,,,,"From Chinese 和 (hé) meaning ""harmony, sum"", 河 (hé) meaning ""river"", 荷 (hé) meaning ""mint, peppermint, lotus"", 合 (hé) meaning ""combine"", or 鹤 (hè) meaning ""crane"" combined with 枝 (zhī) meaning ""branch, twig"", 智 (zhì) meaning ""wisdom, intellect"", 志 (zhì) meaning ""will, purpose, ambition"", or 直 (zhí) meaning ""straight"". Other character combinations can form this name as well."
