Hidaka,m,"陽夏, 陽京, 陽空, 陽高, 陽社, 陽天, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,HEE-DAH-KAH,,,,,,,"From Japanese 陽 (hi) meaning ""light, sun, male"" combined with 夏 (daka) meaning ""summer"", 京 (daka) meaning ""capital"", 空 (daka) meaning ""sky"", 高 (daka) meaning ""tall, high"", 社 (daka) meaning ""company, firm, office, association, shrine"" or 天 (daka) meaning ""heavens, sky, imperial"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
Hidan,m,ひだん(Japanese Hiragana)|飛段(Japanese Kanji),Popular Culture,KHEE-DAHN,,,,,,,"From Japanese 飛 (hi) meaning ""to fly, rapid, overhead"" and 段 (dan) meaning ""grade, rank, step"". Hidan is an antagonist from the manga and anime series 'Naruto'."
Hidayah,,,Indonesian|Malay,/hi.ˈda.jah/(Indonesian),,,,,,,"Means ""guidance"" in Indonesian and Malay, ultimately from Arabic هداية (hidāya). It is sometimes used as a masculine name in Indonesia."
Hidayat Allah,m,هداية الله‎(Arabic),Arabic,/hi.daː.ja.tuɫ.ˈɫaːh/,,,,,,,"Means ""guidance of Allah"" from Arabic هداية (hidāya) meaning ""guidance"" combined with الله‎ (Allah)."
