Hiệu,m,,Vietnamese,/hiəw˧˨ʔ/|/hiw˨˩ʔ/|/hiw˨˩˨/,,,,,,,"From Sino-Vietnamese 效 (hiệu) meaning ""effect, result"". It can also be an altered form of 昊 (hạo) meaning ""sky, heaven"", changed in order to avoid homophony with the name of emperor Kiến Phúc (full name Nguyễn Phúc Hạo)."
