Hinekōrako,f,,Māori|Polynesian Mythology,hin-neh-KOH-rak-ko(Māori),,,,,,,"Means ""white-haired girl"" and ""fair maiden"" in Māori. Hinekōrako is a water spirit and personification of the lunar rainbow."
