Hui-hye,f,희혜(Korean Hangul),Korean (Rare),HEE-HYE,,,,,,,"From Sino-Korean 熙 (hui) meaning ""prosperous; splendid"", 希 (hui) meaning ""to hope, to admire"", 喜 (hui) meaning ""to like; to enjoy"", 晞 (hui) meaning ""dawn"" and 惠 (hye) ""favor, confer kindness"", 蕙 (hye) ""orchid"" or 慧 (hye) ""bright, intelligent"" 炅 (hye) ""brilliance"""
