Hvít,f,,Old Norse|Norse Mythology,,,,,,,,"Feminine form of Hvítr, a by-name meaning ""white"". Hvít appears in the 'Hrólfs saga kraka' as the queen of Norway and the mother of legendary hero Bödvar (Bǫðvarr) Bjarki."
