Hvitserk,m,,Norse Mythology (Anglicized),,,,,,,,"From the Old Norse Hvítserkr, from the elements hvítr ""white"" and serkr ""shirt"". In Norse legend this name belonged to one of the sons of the 9th-century king Ragnar Lodbrok and his wife Kráka."
