Hyun-jae,m,"현재(Korean Hangul)|賢才, 炫才, 鉉才, 賢財, 炫財, 鉉財, etc.(Korean Hanja)",Korean,/çʌ̹n.t͡ɕɛ/,,,,,,,Alternate transcription of Korean Hangeul 현재 (see Hyeon-jae).
Hyun-jeong,,,Korean,,,,,,,,Combination of Hyun and Jeong. Meaning varies depending on characters used.
Hyun-ji,f,,Korean,,,,,,,,Not available.
Hyun-jin,,"현진(Korean Hangul)|賢振, 賢進, 玄振, 顯進, 鉉真, 現塡, etc.(Korean Hanja)",Korean,/çjʌn.d͡ʑin/,,,,,,,Alternate transcription of Korean Hangul 현진 (see Hyeon-jin).
