Iabet,f,,Egyptian Mythology,,,,,,,,"Iabet is a name that refers to Egyptian mythology. Iabet was the goddess of the eastern desert. It was believed that she bathed Ra, the sun god, in the east and was associated with the dawn. Her name was linked to the eastern direction."
