Ianka,f,Янка(Bulgarian),Bulgarian|Flemish (Rare),,,,,,,,"Alternate transcription of Yanka. The name has also seen some use in Flanders, which is the Dutch-speaking part of Belgium. It has not been used in the neighbouring Netherlands, that is to say: no Dutch newborn girls were ever given the name - so far, only immigrants have borne the name.A notable bearer of this name is the Flemish actress and television presenter Ianka Fleerackers (b. 1971)."
