Ibenu,m,,Idoma,,,,,,,,"Ibenu means ""dare not a warrior"" it was given after the Ibenu empire who lived in the Benue-Plateau region before its disintegration. The history was told that Ikwu who beget Ibenu were both warriors. Ibenu beget Nnaji, Nnaji begat Okopi, Okopi begat Ajama, Ajama begat Agbo, Agbo begat Ocheinehi and Itikpo, Ocheinehi begat Ocheibe and Ocheibe begat Oche Nicholas Ibenu"
