İlge,f,,Turkish (Modern),/ˈil.ɟe/,,,,,,,"İlge is the refined, modern iteration of the archaic İlgen, meaning ""evidence,"" ""sign,"" or ""proof."" In the context of naming, it signifies one who provides ""tangible proof of greatness"" or ""a beacon of clarity."" It is a rare, intellectually charged name that links the bearer to the concept of truth and manifestation."
