Iliko,m,ილიკო(Georgian)|Илико(Montenegrin),Georgian|Montenegrin|Literature,,,,,,,,"Georgian diminutive of Ilia. The name might possibly have the same type of etymology in Montenegrin.In Georgian literature, Iliko is the name of the titular character of the book Granny, Iliko, Illarion, and I (1960) written by Nodar Dumbadze (1928-1984). A film based on the book was released in 1962."
