Illyrios,m,Ιλλυριός(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek|Greek Mythology,,,,,,,,"Precise meaning unknown. In Greek mythology, Illyrios was the son of Cadmus and Harmonia, from which the ancient kingdom Illyria (also Illyricum) derived its name."
