Inela,f,,Bosnian,,,,,,,,"Meaning unknown at this time. A famous bearer of this name is Inela Nogić (b. 1976), a Bosnian woman who won a beauty pageant contest during the Siege of Sarajevo (1992-1996). The story behind the contest as well as amateur footage of it led to the making of a documentary titled Miss Sarajevo, which added to the international pressure to end the siege. It also inspired the Irish band U2 to make a song about it, which was also titled Miss Sarajevo and released in 1995."
