Inglor,m,,Literature,,,,,,,,"Inglor was the name of a Ñoldor Elf who was the father of Gildor Inglorion.Inglor is a name in Sindarin meaning ""heart-gold"" or ""heart of gold"", consisting of ind (""some particular purpose or intention of an individual; heart"") from the root id-, glaur (""gold light or colour"") from the root law, and the root ir (""desire, long for"").Inglor was at one point a Sindarin translation of the Quenya name Ingalaurë, which was Finarfin's mother-name.3"
