İntizar,,,Azerbaijani|Turkish (Rare),,,,,,,,"Azerbaijani and Turkish form of Intizar. A known bearer of this name is the Turkish singer İntizar Arslan (b. 1974).In Azerbaijani popular culture, İntizar is the name of a 2007 opera made by the Azerbaijani composer Firəngiz Əlizadə (b. 1947), who is known in English as Franghiz Ali-Zadeh."
