Iracebeth,f,,Popular Culture,er-RASS-i-beth,,,,,,,"This was the Red Queen's real name in Tim Burton's film ""Alice in Wonderland"". Her name was a play on the English word irascible meaning ""easily angered"", with Beth added to it in order to make it look more like a real feminine name."
