Irandokht,f,ایراندخت(Persian),Iranian,,,,,,,,"Likely using the suffix -dokht, meaning ""daughter"". This was the name of a princess of the Qajar dynasty."
I-rang,f,이랑(Korean Hangul)|俐荣(Korean Hanja),Korean (Rare),EE-RANG,,,,,,,"From Sino-Korean 俐 (i) ""smooth; active; clever, sharp"" combined with 荣 (rang) meaning ""glory, honour, flourish, prosper"". Other hanja combinations are possible."
Irani,f,,Tupi|Brazilian,,,,,,,,Of uncertain origin and meaning.
