Isaios,m,Ἰσαῖος(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek,,,,,,,,"Derived from Greek ἰσαῖος (isaios) meaning ""equality"". Also compare Greek ἴσος (isos) ""equal"", which is seen in Isocrates. Last but not least, this name is not to be confused with the name Isaias: while it may look similar, Isaios is not a hellenized form of Isaias."
