Itaru,m,"到, 暢, 格, 至, 之(Japanese Kanji)|いたる(Japanese Hiragana)|イタル(Japanese Katakana)",Japanese,EE-TA-OO,,,,,,,"This name can be used as 到 (tou, ita.ru) meaning ""arrival, attain, reach, result in,"" 暢 (chou, nobi.ru, itaru) meaning ""stretch, relax,"" 格 (kaku, kyoku, kou, gou, itaru) meaning ""capacity, character, rank, status,"" 至 (shi, ita.ru), with the same meaning as 到, or 之 (shi, oite, kono, kore, no, yuku, itaru) meaning ""of, this.""This name was most commonly used in the first half of the 20th century but nowadays, it's rarely given to boys, if given at all."
