Ithuriel,m,,Judeo-Christian-Islamic Legend,,,,,,,,"Apparently means ""discovery of God"" in Hebrew, according to some sources. However, it could possibly instead mean ""the light of God is with me"", derived from Hebrew 'itay ""with me"", uri ""light, fire"" and el ""God"". See also Ithai (and perhaps Ithiel, too) and Uriel. Ithuriel was the name of an angel in Judeo-Christian legend."
