Iunit,f,,Egyptian Mythology,,,,,,,,"Iunit of Armant means ""she of Armant"". Armant, also known as Hermonthis, is a town in Egypt whose name is derived from Montu. In Egyptian mythology she was a minor goddess and a consort of Montu.There is, however, another Iunit who was a minor goddess of death. She is mentioned in the Ancient Egyptian Book of the Dead and seems to have had a close connection to Iah. It is uncertain whether she is identical with Iunit of Armant."
