Ivalo,f,,Greenlandic|Danish,EE-vah-loo(Greenlandic)|EE-vah-lo(Danish),,,,,,,Older form of Ivalu (according to the 1973 spelling reform of Greenlandic) as well as a Danish variant. It is borne by Princess Josephine Sophia Ivalo Mathilda of Denmark (2011-).
