Iven,m,,German|Literature|Low German,EE-vən,,,,,,,"Iven is a variant of the Gemanic name Ivo 1 which is traced to a word meaning ""yew"" (the wood of the yew was used for building good bows).Iven Johns is a figure in The Rider on the White Horse by Theodor Storm."
