Iverna,f,,English (Rare)|Dutch (Rare),,,,,,,,"Old Latin form of a lost Celtic name which also gave modern Irish Erin and was corrupted to Hibernia. Therefore a rather esoteric reference to Ireland. Variant Juverna has also been used, but both forms are rare."
