İzem,f,,Turkish,/i.zem/,,,,,,,"İzem is a refined Turkic construction from İz (""trace, footprint, path"") and the possessive identifier -(e)m. It signifies ""my legacy"" or ""the trace I leave behind,"" symbolizing the ""imprint of one’s spirit upon the path of time."" It represents the ""quiet resonance of an individual’s journey,"" the essence that remains when the path is walked with purpose."
