Jaazaniah,m,יַאֲזַנְיָה(Ancient Hebrew),Biblical,,,,,,,,"From Hebrew יַאֲזַנְיָה (Ya'azanyá) meaning ""may Yahweh hear"", from the roots אָזַן (azán) ""to hear"", a denominative verb of אֹזֶן (ózen) ""ear"", and יָהּ yah, referring to the Hebrew God. This is the name of various minor characters in the Old Testament."
