Jiawei,,"家炜, 家卫, 家伟, 家玮, 家威, 嘉威, 嘉蔚, 嘉伟, 佳薇, etc.(Chinese)|家煒, 家衛, 家偉, 家瑋, 家威, 嘉威, 嘉蔚, 嘉偉, 佳薇, etc.(Traditional Chinese)",Chinese,/t͡ɕjɑ.weɪ̯/,,,,,,,"From Chinese 家 (jiā) meaning ""home, family"", 嘉 (jiā) meaning ""good, fine, excellent, auspicious"" or 佳 (jiā) meaning ""good, auspicious, beautiful"" combined with 炜 (wěi) meaning ""flaming, bright, glowing"", 卫 (wèi) meaning ""guard, protect"", 伟 (wěi) meaning ""great, robust, extraordinary"", 玮 (wěi) meaning ""precious, rare, valuable, jade"", 威 (wēi) meaning ""power, pomp"", 蔚 (wèi) meaning ""luxuriant, lush, grand, magnificent"" or 薇 (wēi) meaning ""fern"". Other character combinations can form this name as well."
