Jiezhen,,"杰珍, 杰真, 杰臻, 洁珍, 洁真, 洁贞, etc.(Chinese)|傑珍, 傑真, 傑臻, 潔珍, 潔真, 潔貞, etc.(Traditional Chinese)",Chinese,/t͡ɕjɛ.ʈ͡ʂən/,,,,,,,"From Chinese 杰 (jié) meaning ""heroic, outstanding"" or 洁 (jié) meaning ""clean, pure"" combined with 珍 (zhēn) meaning ""precious, rare"", 真 (zhēn) meaning ""real, genuine, true"", 臻 (zhēn) meaning ""arrive, reach, attain, realise"" or 贞 (zhēn) meaning ""virtuous, chaste, loyal"". Other character combinations can form this name as well."
