Jiilaal,m,,Somali,,,,,,,,"Jiilaal is a Somali name with the following characteristics:Meaning: Jiilaal refers to the ""dry season"" or ""dry period"" in Somali. It is often associated with the dry season of the Somali climate.Origin: It is derived from the Somali language, where ""jiilaal"" denotes the time of year when there is little to no rain, which is a significant period in the nomadic and pastoral lifestyle of Somalia."
