Jotia,m,"ჟოტია, ჯოტია(Georgian)",Georgian (Rare),,,,,,,,"When written as ჟოტია, this name is a variant transcription of Zhotia.When written as ჯოტია, it can be a diminutive of Joto as well as be a variant of Zhotia.The etymology is the same either way, as both names are ultimately derived from Ancient Greek ἰῶτα (iota) meaning ""jot, a small amount""."
