Jūrōta,m,"十郎太, 重郎太, 十朗太, 重朗太(Japanese Kanji)|じゅうろうた(Japanese Hiragana)|ジュウロウタ(Japanese Katakana)",Japanese (Rare),JUU:-ṘO:-TAH,,,,,,,"This name combines 十 (ji', juu, ju', to, too) meaning ""ten"" or 重 (juu, chou, e, omo, omo.i, omo.ri, kasa.naru, kasa.neru) meaning ""heap up, heavy, pile up"" & 郎 (ryou, rou, otoko) meaning ""son"" or 朗 (rou, aki.raka, hoga.raka) meaning ""bright, cheerful, clear, merry"" with 太 (ta, tai, futo.i, futo.ru) meaning ""big plump, thick.""One bearer of this name is voice actor Jūrōta Kosugi (小杉 十郎太) (1957-).This name is very rarely given to boys, if given at all."
