Jutarō,m,"壽太郎, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,,,,,,,,"From Japanese 壽 (ju) meaning ""longevity, long life"", 太 (ta) meaning ""thick, big"" combined with 郎 (rou) meaning ""son"". Other combinations of kanji characters are also possible.Famous bearer of this name is Japanese diplomat Komura Jutarō."
