Kaena,f,"加恵奈, 夏絵菜, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,KAH-E-NAH,,,,,,,"From Japanese 加 (ka) meaning ""increase"" or 夏 (ka) meaning ""summer"", 恵 (e) meaning ""favour, benefit"" or 絵 (e) meaning ""picture, painting, drawing, sketch"" combined with 奈 (na) meaning ""apple tree"" or 菜 (na) meaning ""vegetables, greens"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
