ǂKá̦gára,m,,San Mythology|Astronomy,,,,,,,,"Meaning unknown. In the San mythology, he existed along with his brother-in-law ǃHãunu, which they both fought with lightning that causes massive storms. The minor planet (469705) ǂKá̦gára was named after him too.Note: The ""ǂ"" sign reflects Latin alveolar click."
