Kainoa,,,Hawaiian,[kɐj.ˈno.wə],,,,,,,"This name can mean ""sea of freedom,"" which would derive from kai meaning ""sea, sea water"" and noa meaning ""freedom,"" or ""the namesake,"" which would derive from ka, which is a definite article, and inoa meaning ""name(sake)."""
