Kakashi,m,,Popular Culture,kah-kah-shee|ku-KA-shee|ka-ka-she,,,,,,,"The name is derived from two parts, KAKA being 'Scare,' and SHI being 'Crow.' Thus, the name in general means 'SCARECROW.' It is the name of a protagonist in the Japanese anime 'Naruto' as the teacher of the main protagonist. It is also the name of a prince in the Japanese film 'Howl's Moving Castle' who is temporarily transformed int a scarecrow."
