Kaladin,m,,Literature|English (Modern),/ˈkæl.ə.dɪn/|/ˈkɑl.ə.dɪn/,,,,,,,"Kaladin Stormblessed is one of the main protagonists in The Stormlight Archive (2010-) series of fantasy novels by Brandon Sanderson.Kaladin's name comes from the combining of the name Kalak and the Alethi suffix -din. His name means ""born unto eternity"" in the fictional Alethi language.Based off one of the Heralds (Kalak)."
