Kaleena,f,,"English (American, Modern, Rare)",/kə.ˈliː.nə/(American English),,,,,,,"Likely a combination of the phonetic elements ka, lee and na. This name had a spike in popularity in America after child actress Kaleena Kiff appeared on the sitcom 'Love, Sidney' (1981-1983)."
