Kalliades,m,Καλλιάδης(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek,/kal.li.á.dɛːs/(Attic Greek)|/kal.li.ˈa.ðis/(Koine Greek),,,,,,,Derived from the Ancient Greek given name Kallias and the patronymic suffix ἴδης (ides).
