Kalomoira,f,Καλομοίρα(Greek),Greek,,,,,,,,"Means ""beautiful fate"", derived from the Greek elements καλος (kalos) ""beautiful, fair"" and μοιρα (moira) ""share, fate"". A known bearer is the Greek-American pop singer Kalomira Sarantis (1985-)."
