Kalyanavarman,m,,Sanskrit|History,,,,,,,,"From Sanskrit कल्याण (kalyāṇa) ""beautiful, charming, auspicious"" and वर्मन् (varman) ""protection, armor"". This was the name of the 4th ruler of the Varman dynasty, ruling for the period of 422 to 446 AD."
