Kamik,,,Greenlandic,,,,,,,,"From Greenlandic kamik ""kamik"", ""soft boot made of reindeer or sealskin"". Soles, kamiks (boots), legs and feet were linked to sexuality and reproduction, hunting and magic (success in hunting) in traditional society."
