Kamma,f,,Danish (Rare)|Icelandic (Rare),KAHM-mah(Danish),,,,,,,"Originally a diminutive of double names in which the first name began with Ka- and the second name began with Ma- (such as Karen-Margrethe, as in the case of Karen Margrethe ""Kamma"" Rahbek (1775-1829), a Danish woman of letters). It is also sometimes considered a diminutive of Kamilla."
