Kamuy,,"カムィ(Ainu Katakana, Japanese Katakana)",Ainu|Far Eastern Mythology|Japanese Mythology,,,,,,,,"Refers to a spiritual or divine entity in the mythology of the indigenous Ainu people of Japan. The term shares similarities with the Japanese word ""kami"" (神) in both phonology and meaning."
