Katrinelje,f,,German (Archaic),kah-tree-NEL-yə,,,,,,,"Very obscure diminutive of Katharina. This is the name of a character in the German fairy tale Fair Katrinelje and Pif-Paf-Poltrie, collected by the Brothers Grimm."
