Katrya,f,Катря(Ukrainian),Ukrainian,,,,,,,,Diminutive and folk form of Kateryna. Katrya Hrynevycheva (1875-1947) was an Ukrainian writer and activist.
Katryen,f,,English (Rare),kah-TREEN,,,,,,,Not available.
Katryn,f,,Afrikaans,,,,,,,,Afrikaans form of Katrijn.
