Katsche,m,,"German (Modern, Rare)",KAT-shə,,,,,,,Katsche is the nickname of the German football player Hans-Georg Schwarzenbeck. It came out of nowhere and has no known meaning.
Katsia,m,კაცია(Georgian)|Каця(Belarusian),Georgian (Archaic)|Belarusian,,,,,,,,"Derived from the Georgian noun კაცი (katsi) meaning ""man"" as well as ""human"".This name was borne by two 18th-century princes of Mingrelia, who both belonged to the House of Dadiani."
