Kengani,m,,Kongo,Keingany,,,,,,,"Kengani is an African language, that belongs to Bantu people, designated from Congo kingdom in area that now is called Angola(Uige province).Which is used for Kings, liders, Boss, or heroes.The meaning is: Someone who give solution to any problem, but not spiritual problem.this name it's only used for one family, whoever have this name belongs to the family. the king died in 80's, and all his son should have one Kengani among his sons. and the most king loved son had a son whom he called Kengani Capitão Manuel, Who is is going to rule Africa and the world in future......................................................................................................................................................................he will overpower everyone, and create the new world order."
