Kikue,f,"キクヱ(Japanese Katakana)|きくえ, きくゑ(Japanese Hiragana)|喜久栄, 喜久江, 喜玖枝, 希久江, 希玖枝, 季久恵, 季玖絵, 記久枝, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,KEE-KOO-E,,,,,,,"From Japanese 喜 (ki) meaning ""rejoice"", 久 (ku) meaning ""long time"" combined with 絵 (e) meaning ""picture, painting, drawing, sketch"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
