Kinana,f,كِنَانةَ(Arabic),Arabic,kih-NAH-nuh,,,,,,,"Kinana means “quiver”, as in a container that holds arrows. Kinana is also the name of an Arabian tribe to which the Prophet Muhammad belonged. (He belonged to the Quraysh, a branch of the Kinana.)"
