Kina-sut-kamuy,m,"キナスッカムイ(Ainu Katakana, Japanese Katakana)",Ainu|Far Eastern Mythology|Japanese Mythology,,,,,,,,"Ainu god (Kamuy) of snakes, depicted as the brother of Nusa-kor-kamuy (occasionally, they are even regarded as the same entity)."
