Kirato,m,"キラト(Japanese Katakana)|きらと(Japanese Hiragana)|燦東, 煌仁, 輝徒, 耀翔, 光騰, 帰来瞳, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,KEE-RA-TO,,,,,,,"From Japanese 光 (kira) meaning ""light"" or 輝 (kira) meaning ""brightness; lustre; brilliance; radiance; splendour"" combined with 翔 (to) meaning ""soar, fly"", 仁 (to) meaning ""benevolence"" or 瞳 (to) meaning ""pupil"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
