Kiruna,f,,"Swedish (Rare)|English (Australian, Rare)",/ˈkǐː.rʉ.na/(Swedish),,,,,,,"From the name of the Swedish city of Kiruna, derived from Northern Sámi giron ""rock ptarmigan"", via the Finnish form kiiruna."
