Kiruththikan,m,கிருத்திகன்(Tamil),Tamil,/kɪɻut̪ːɪɡaɳ/,,,,,,,"Derived from “Krittika” (Sanskrit: कृत्तिका), which refers to the Pleiades star cluster. In Tamil and Hindu tradition, Krittika is also the name of one of the six foster mothers of the god Murugan (also called Kartikeya), a prominent deity in Tamil culture."
