Kisara,f,"キサラ(Japanese Katakana)|きさら(Japanese Hiragana)|祇更, 騎新, 綺皿, 木沙良, 著相羅, etc.(Japanese Kanji)|كيزارا(Arabic)",Japanese|Arabic,KEE-SA-RA|Key-Sah-Rah,,,,,,,"This name is usually spelled with katakana, but it can also be spelled with 綺 (ki) meaning ""thin silk"", 沙 (sa) meaning ""sand"", and 良 (ra) meaning ""good"". There are other possible kanji combinations.A notable fictional bearer is Kisara (キサラ) from 'Engage Kiss', a mixed media project created by Aniplex."
