Komaki,f,"小巻, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,KO-MA-KEE,,,,,,,"From Japanese 小 (ko) meaning ""small, little, short"" combined with 巻 (maki) meaning ""a scroll or book"". Other kanji combinations are possible."
