Kosala,m,කෝසල(Sinhala),Sinhalese,,,,,,,,"From the name of the ancient kingdom of Kosala, which existed from the 7th to 5th centuries BCE in what is now northern India and Nepal. In the Hindu epic the Ramayana this was the kingdom of the hero Rama."
