Kosenc,m,,Croatian (Rare)|Slavic Mythology,,,,,,,,"An old Croatian name of unknown meaning.According to folk tradition the Croats were led into the province of Dalmatia by a group of five brothers, Klukas, Lobel, Kosenc, Muhlo and Hrvat, and their two sisters, Tuga and Buga, in the 7th century AD."
