Krakuchchanda,m,क्रकुच्छन्द(Sanskrit),Buddhism,,,,,,,,"Possibly from an old Sanskrit name derived from ककुद् (kakud) meaning ""summit, peak"" and संधा (saṃdhā) meaning ""to join, to bring together, to unite"". In Buddhist tradition this is the name of the 25th of the 27 buddhas preceding Siddhartha Gautama, known in Pali as Kakusandha."
