Krastan,m,Кръстан(Bulgarian),Bulgarian,,,,,,,,"Derived from Bulgarian кръст (krast) meaning ""cross"" (see Krastyo). This name is sometimes mistaken for a variant form of Kristiyan.Known bearers of this name include the Bulgarian revolutionary Krastan Poptodorov (died in 1943) and Krastan Dyankov (1933-1999), a Bulgarian journalist, essayist and translator."
