Kumika,f,"空見花, 空美夏, 空美香, 久未佳, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,KOO-MEE-KAH,,,,,,,"From Japanese 空 (ku) meaning ""sky"", 見 (mi) meaning ""to see"" combined with 花 (ka) meaning ""flower"". Other kanji combinations are possible as well."
