Kumino,f,"久実乃, 久美乃, 晋乃, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,KOO-MEE-NO,,,,,,,"From Japanese 久 (ku) meaning ""long time"", 美 (mi) meaning ""beautiful"" combined with 乃 (no), a possessive particle. Other combinations of kanji characters can also form this name."
