Kurszán,m,,Medieval Hungarian,,,,,,,,Not available.
Kürt,m,,Hungarian,,,,,,,,"From the name of an ancient Hungarian tribe. This tribal name was probably of Turkish origin and possibly meant ""snow slip, avalanche"". This name should not be confused with unrelated name Kurt.The Hungarian name days for Kürt are February 14 and February 19."
Kurt,m,Քուրդ(Armenian),Armenian (Archaic),,,,,,,,Alternate transcription of Armenian Քուրդ (see Kurd).
Kurtamet,m,Куртамет(Crimean Tatar),Crimean Tatar,,,,,,,,Not available.
