Kyōsuke,m,"きょうすけ(Japanese Hiragana)|キョウスケ(Japanese Katakana)|喬助, 恭輔, 享介, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,KYO-SKEH,,,,,,,Variant transcription of Kyousuke.
