Kyousuke,m,"きょうすけ(Japanese Hiragana)|キョウスケ(Japanese Katakana)|教甫, 郷資, 馨典, 叶丞, 享右, 共涼, 香亮, 匡透, 叫翼, 喬祐, 恭佐, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,KYO-SKEH,,,,,,,"From Japanese 強 (kyou) meaning ""strength"" combined with 輔 (suke) meaning ""help"". Other kanji combinations are possible.Famous bearers are Kyousuke Himuro, a Japanese singer (1960-) and Kyousuke Ikeda (1992-), a Japanese actor."
