Lamaria,f,ლამარია(Georgian),Georgian Mythology|African American,lə-MAHR-ee-ah,,,,,,,"Meaning unknown. Lamaria is a goddess in Georgian mythology and a part of the Svan pantheon. She is named ""eye of the earth"" and is the goddess of the hearth, cattle and a protector of women (especially with matters of childbirth)."
