Lâm Cung Thánh Mẫu,f,,Vietnamese Mythology,/ˈləm˧˧ ˈkʊwŋ͡m˧˧ ˈtʰajŋ̟˧˦ ˈməw˦ˀ˥/|/ˈləm˧˧ ˈkʊwŋ͡m˧˧ ˈtʰɛɲ˦˧˥ ˈməw˧˨/|/ˈləm˧˧ ˈkʊwŋ͡m˧˧ ˈtʰan˦˥ ˈməw˨˩˦/,,,,,,,"The princess of the forest in Vietnamese mythology. Her name is derived from Sino-Vietnamese 林 (lâm) meaning ""forest"", 宮 (cung) meaning ""palace, temple"", 聖 (thánh) meaning ""holy, sacred"", and 母 (mẫu) meaning ""mother""."
