Lamprias,m,Λαμπρίας(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek,,,,,,,,"Derived from Ancient Greek λαμπρός (lampros), meaning ""bright, brilliant, radiant"" or ""well-known, illustrious"" (see lampo). This was the name of both a grandfather and brother of the philosopher Plutarch."
