Lampus,m,Λάμπος(Ancient Greek),Greek Mythology (Latinized)|Ancient Greek (Latinized),,,,,,,,"Latinized form of Lampos. This was the name of several figures in Greek mythology, including one of the fifty sons of King Aegyptus who was killed by his wife, Ocypete, on their wedding night. It is also the name of at least four horses in Greek mythology."
