Lamtanganba,m,ꯇꯩꯇꯩꯇꯃ(Meitei),Manipuri,lɑmtɑŋɑnbɑ,,,,,,,"Means ""born in Lamta"" in Meitei. Lamta is the last month of the Meithei lunar year, usually equivalent to February."
