Land,f,,Old Irish (Rare),,,,,,,,Variant of Flann. This was the name of a 9th-century Irish princess who was married three times successively to three different kings; she helped cement alliances and protect her kingdoms against Viking threats. Her name is sometimes realized as Lann or Flann.
