Laquanda,f,,African American,,,,,,,,"Combination of the phonetic elements la, quan and da, sharing a sound with names such as LaWanda and Lashonda. It can be spelled Laquanda or with a capitalized third letter as LaQuanda."
Laquandra,f,,African American (Rare),lə-KWAHN-drə,,,,,,,"Combination of the phonetic elements la, quan and dra; in other words, an elaborated form of Laquanda, blending it with a name ending in dra such as Sondra. It can be spelled Laquandra or LaQuandra, as in the case of the American health official Dr. LaQuandra S. Nesbitt, who served as the Washington, D.C. Department of Health Director from 2015 to 2022."
